   LOW / PLAN / HIGH, output A PLAN / HIGH, efficiency and loss at PLAN), and each converter against its limit (the current judged at PLAN /
   HIGH, the limit, the margin at HIGH; an input-side limit is judged on the state's input power over VBAT's 9.688 V floor, at HIGH with
   every load evaluated at that floor). DRAWN's margins follow where its converters differ. Status: RV rv-pwr's row unchanged, MAIN a change on main since 1f614233, DRAFTED a draft not
